--- !u!114 &6713915946082426252
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2323340414790000396}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 661491cbc727fd646af002dc43f8e6e3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _popupText: {fileID: 807850918260551444}
  _popupContainer: {fileID: 6666784284745599528}
  _settingsPopup: {fileID: 7564466390374799337}
  _textPopup: {fileID: 140077328458359955}
  _inputPopup: {fileID: 442695086}
  _deletePopup: {fileID: 803917953}
  _mainMenu: {fileID: 7559822463024475675}
  continueButton: {fileID: 3322520088036514526}
  continueTextButton: {fileID: 863512551626069145}
  restartButton: {fileID: 8159851609557421802}
  robot: {fileID: 5716703532665800452}
  entryTexts:
  - "Welcome to your lab, scientist! I am S.T.O.N.E. \u2014 your Scientific Technologic
    Operational Neuro-Evolver. My purpose? To assist you in mastering the art of
    creature fusion in your state-of-the-art facility."
  - "You\u2019ll start with just three small creatures with low stats and dive into
    the world of fusion. Experiment by fusing monsters to enhance their stats, purchase
    new or upgraded specimens, and build a collection of fearsome Monkepok. "
  - "But it\u2019s not just about creating bizarre creatures \u2014 your lab is constantly
    under threat from enemies eager to steal your research. You\u2019ll need to defend
    it by unleashing your creatures in strategic battles."
  - Prove your genius, perfect your experiments, and rise as the ultimate mad scientist! 
    Good luck, Master!
  - "Left-click on a Monkepok in your inventory to check its stats. When you're ready,
    send it into battle by pressing \"Fight!\" If things take a turn for the worse,
    you can retreat at any time to save your creature \u2014 because once it dies,
    it\u2019s gone for good. "
  - 'Your Monkepok fully recovers HP between battles, but remember: if you retreat,
    the enemy heals too. Plan your moves carefully!'
  - "In the bottom-right corner, you'll find your inventory. The mini-screen on the
    left shows how many space slots you have available, while the mini-screen on
    the right displays your Genes \u2014 your currency."
  battleTexts: []
  inspectorTexts:
  - "On this screen, you can compare two Monkepok by right- or left-clicking to check
    their stats. PWR stands for Power Level. Place your strongest creatures in the
    test tubes, then press the red button to fuse them. Don\u2019t worry \u2014 the
    parent Monkepok will remain in your inventory! The fusion cost is displayed above
    the middle tube. "
  - 'To remove a Monkepok from the side tubes, press the "X" next to the tube. '
  - 'Fusion creatures can inherit colours and body parts from their parents, with
    a chance for random mutations. Stats are passed down as well, though mutations
    may positively or negatively affect them. '
  - 'If you no longer need a Monkepok, you can sell it for Genes equal to its PWR. '
  fusionTexts:
  - This is the Fusion Screen. Once fused, press the button to collect your new creature.
    You can re-fuse them for half the price to roll for different stats, or sell
    them straight away.
  configTexts:
  - Are you really a mad scientist if you don't tweek and modifiy your creatures
    until they fit your taste? FEAR NOT!
  - In this menu you're able to take one of your creatures and modify them as much
    as you want - for now!
  - Future update will contain a heavy price but also some boosts depending on which
    creature you build!
  - Enjoy!
  shopTexts:
  - "Here, you can buy basic or advanced Monkepok, or expand your inventory to hold
    more creatures. Be mindful of your storage limit! Keep an eye on your Genes so
    you don\u2019t run out and halt your research progress. Spend wisely! "
  currentState: 0
  currentTexts: []
  currentPage: 0
  inputField: {fileID: 1569085859}
